&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9IVhc_4R5nUQ7kNvwGNOKme&_nc_oc=AdlJgNOGNisl5YjzRDuV9Q3ZqV-AQVDY1ZufcEAAptg6IQYKnZqCGXtp9qUxvedH7J0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxuKJAhLriCHyjgEk30zT4KsHqdvDdfIk7fqXH2t6MydQ&oe=69B956BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoThumbnailforAccelerate_temp_2.png", "id": "1657469835145238", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982492_1657469838478571_4205052966596679185_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RF1BrkDBVeYQ7kNvwF3dOWx&_nc_oc=Adl2-z9heEzePzKBjqHH2w9VP1MjYeZwK54OwivEPdm1LY3hkeR7x39q8LaJ2iYSPvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwShOsTdVvkHJqxqaR8Biqih3RwLqKW945U9PcAhpbSVQ&oe=69B94C12"}, "display_name": "Accelerate", "keywords": ["Accelerate", "Laboratory", "Fourplus", "CellTherapy", "Bioscience"], "long_description": "Accelerate is a virtual reality training program for GMP operators, designed around Cell & Gene Therapy Catapult\u2019s manufacturing centre in Stevenage, UK. Accelerate navigates trainees through an immersive GMP compliant manufacturing facility, with standardized, modular content spanning: Cleaning, Gowning, Compliance and Health & Safety. The interactive laboratory walkthroughs and simulations provides exposure to a real-life facility, without the risks associated with in-person training.  \n\nAccelerate gives learners the opportunity to experience industry-relevant settings, bioproduction laboratories and clean rooms. In addition, the spillage training applies context to cell and gene transplants within a healthcare facility.  \n\nRemove barriers to high-stakes training and increase workforce competency with Accelerate.  ", "short_description": "Accelerate is a virtual reality training program for GMP operators, designed around Cell & Gene Therapy Catapult\u2019s manufacturing centre in Stevenage, UK. Accelerate navigates trainees through an immersive GMP compliant manufacturing facility, 